<title>UK: EIB sets 500 mln Czech crown four-year bond.</title>
<headline>EIB sets 500 mln Czech crown four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hambros.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN CZK   COUPON     11.50     MATURITY    30.JUL.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.45    PAY DATE    30.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 25-250-2.5M</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   SALE LIMS  UK	  TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p> NOTES	500 MILLION CZECH CROWN = ($15.4 MILLION)</p>
<p>					     ($ = 32.52 CZECH CROWNS)</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
